mindmap
  root(("Blade Templating"))
    Echo Syntax
      Escaped: Two curly braces dollar var two curly braces
      Unescaped: Exclamation mark two curly braces dollar var two curly braces exclamation mark
      Comments: Two curly braces dash dash space dash dash two curly braces
    Control Structures
      Conditionals: at if / at unless / at isset / at empty
      Loops: at for / at foreach / at forelse
      Loop Variables: dollar loop arrow index comma dollar loop arrow first
      Auth: at auth / at guest
    Template Inheritance
      at extends Parent layout
      at section slash at yield Named sections
      at parent Include parent content
      at stack slash at push Deferred injection
    Components
      Class-based: php artisan make:component
      Anonymous: dash dash view flag comma at props
      Slots: dollar slot slash Named slots
      Attributes: dollar attributes arrow merge
    Vite Integration
      at vite HMR in dev
      Production builds with hashes
      vite.config.js with laravel plugin
    Forms and CSRF
      at csrf Token protection
      at method PUT slash PATCH slash DELETE
      old Helper retains input
      at error Per-field errors
    Partials
      at include slash at includeIf
      at each Collection rendering
      at once Single render
